{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53921","headline":"寄剡谿友 · 项斯","name":"寄剡谿友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"歇马亭西酒一巵，半年闲事亦堪悲。\n船横镜水人眠後，蓼暗松江雁下时。\n山晚迥寻萧寺宿，雪寒谁与戴家期。\n夜来忽觉秋风急，应有鲈鱼触钓丝。\n（见宋高似孙《剡录》卷六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项斯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}